Third-party components

Optimal Context Mapping installs and uses these open-source components, each under its own licence. None of them is
modified or bundled in this package; pip installs them from their usual sources.

- NumPy: BSD 3-Clause licence.
- PyTorch: BSD 3-Clause licence.
- Hugging Face transformers, tokenizers, safetensors and huggingface-hub: Apache License 2.0.
- BAAI/bge-base-en-v1.5 (the embedding model, downloaded once from Hugging Face on the first build): MIT licence.

Optional, only if you use the matching provider in `ocm hybrid`: anthropic (MIT), openai (Apache 2.0).
